# CMDEDIT-HIER-11: archive writeall arch.mag; archive read into a fresh cell; archive write (Q-CMDEDIT-34).
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/tiny -noprompt
load a
load a
box 0 0 10 10
paint metal1
save a
load top
box 0 0 0 0
getcell a
box 20 0 30 10
paint metal2
archive writeall arch.mag
load z
archive read arch.mag
cellname list allcells
archive write
